      "id": "en:body",
      "locale": "en_US",
      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Sylas quickly dashes, and prepares a Recast for 3.5 seconds. Recast: Sylas throws his chains, pulling himself to the first enemy hit, dealing (80/130/180/230/280 + (80% Ability Power)) magic damage, and Knocking Up for 0.5 seconds.",
      "variant": null
    },
